### Managed by the ludus_threat_hunting Ansible role -- local edits are lost.
###
### Standalone layout: one Zeek process sniffing one interface. This is the
### right shape for a Ludus range sensor; a cluster layout only pays off above
### roughly 1 Gbps of sustained traffic and needs an AF_PACKET or PF_RING
### load balancer plugin that these packages do not ship.

[zeek]
type=standalone
host=localhost
interface={{ ludus_threat_hunting_iface }}
